            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chicken "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "korma",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "korma"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is a mild, fragrant curry made with ground almonds, coconut milk, and warm spices. There is no chilli heat; the depth comes from cardamom, cinnamon, and a long, slow cook. The ground almonds thicken the sauce and give it a nutty richness without flour. It is good for anyone who does not like hot food and is one of the easiest curries to make."
          }
        ]
